<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta
    name="description"
    content="Damiam V. Henry — author, poet, digital broadcaster, contemplative philosopher."
  />
  <title>Damiam V. Henry | Author & Contemplative Philosopher</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #1c2623;
      --muted: #5b6963;
      --paper: #f7f3ee;
      --cream: #efeae1;
      --sage: #c6d3bf;
      --deep: #213d37;
      --line: rgba(28, 38, 35, 0.14);
      --serif: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      --sans: Inter, "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--paper);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: var(--sans);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    img { max-width: 100%; display: block; }

    .container {
      width: min(1100px, calc(100% - 40px));
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .site-header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 20;
      background: rgba(247, 243, 238, 0.9);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      min-height: 74px;
    }

    .brand {
      font-family: var(--serif);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 28px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover, .socials a:hover, .text-link:hover {
      color: var(--deep);
    }

    .hero {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 0.7fr;
      gap: 70px;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 650px;
      padding: 70px 0 80px;
    }

    .eyebrow, .section-label {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--deep);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    h1, h2, h3 {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: var(--serif);
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    h1 {
      margin-top: 16px;
      font-size: clamp(3.3rem, 7vw, 6.3rem);
    }

    h1 em {
      color: var(--deep);
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .lead {
      max-width: 620px;
      margin-top: 22px;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 34px;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 13px 20px;
      border: 1px solid var(--deep);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: 0.2s ease;
    }

    .button-primary {
      background: var(--deep);
      color: var(--paper);
    }

    .button-secondary {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--deep);
    }

    .button-primary:hover {
      background: #152d29;
    }

    .button-secondary:hover {
      background: var(--sage);
    }

    .hero-note {
      background: var(--sage);
      padding: 36px 28px 32px;
      transform: rotate(2deg);
      box-shadow: 16px 16px 0 var(--cream);
    }

    .quote-mark {
      display: block;
      font-family: var(--serif);
      font-size: 5rem;
      line-height: 0.7;
      color: var(--deep);
    }

    .hero-note p {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: var(--serif);
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      line-height: 1.35;
    }

    .intro-band {
      background: var(--cream);
      padding: 40px 0;
    }

    .intro-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .intro-text {
      font-family: var(--serif);
      font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2vw, 2.2rem);
      line-height: 1.3;
      margin: 0;
      max-width: 820px;
    }

    .section {
      padding: 110px 0;
    }

    .section-heading {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin-bottom: 52px;
    }

    .section-heading h2 {
      margin-top: 12px;
      font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 5vw, 4.4rem);
    }

    .section-heading p:not(.section-label) {
      margin-top: 18px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .two-column {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 76px;
    }

    .large-copy {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: var(--serif);
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 2.5vw, 2.7rem);
      line-height: 1.25;
    }

    .two-column p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.02rem;
    }

    .tinted {
      background: var(--cream);
    }

    .book-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .book-card {
      background: var(--paper);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      min-height: 220px;
      padding: 24px 20px;
    }

    .book-card span, .belief span {
      color: var(--deep);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .book-card h3 {
      margin-top: 26px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 1.6rem;
    }

    .book-card p, .belief p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.92rem;
    }

    .text-link {
      color: var(--deep);
      font-weight: 700;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--deep);
      padding-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .belief-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 26px;
    }

    .belief {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding-top: 20px;
    }

    .belief h3 {
      margin: 22px 0 12px;
      font-size: 1.6rem;
    }

    .audio-section {
      background: var(--deep);
      color: var(--paper);
    }

    .audio-content {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: end;
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .audio-content .section-label {
      color: var(--sage);
    }

    .audio-content h2 {
      margin-top: 12px;
      font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
    }

    .audio-content p {
      margin-top: 16px;
      max-width: 620px;
      color: #d8e0dc;
      font-size: 1.04rem;
    }

    .button-light {
      color: var(--paper);
      border-color: var(--sage);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .button-light:hover {
      background: var(--sage);
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .contact-section {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .contact-section .section-heading {
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }

    .email {
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: var(--serif);
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
      color: var(--deep);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--deep);
      padding-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .socials {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 40px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 24px 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .footer .container {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .hero {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 40px;
        min-height: auto;
      }

      .book-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }

      .belief-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }

      .two-column, .intro-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .audio-content {
        display: block;
      }

      .button-light {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-top: 24px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .container {
        width: min(100% - 28px, 1100px);
      }

      .nav-links {
        display: none;
      }

      .book-grid, .belief-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .hero-note {
        padding: 26px 22px;
      }

      .footer .container {
        display: block;
      }

      .footer .container span {
        display: block;
        margin: 6px 0;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <nav class="nav container" aria-label="Main Navigation">
      <a href="#top" class="brand">Damiam V. Henry</a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#works">Books</a>
        <a href="#beliefs">Beliefs</a>
        <a href="#audio">Audio</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main id="top">
    <section class="hero container">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Author • Digital Broadcaster • Contemplative Philosopher</p>
        <h1>
          A faith that thinks.<br />
          <em>A life that keeps learning.</em>
        </h1>
        <p class="lead">
          Damiam V. Henry writes from the intersection of faith, thought, experience,
          fatherhood, and spiritual discovery.
        </p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button button-primary" href="#works">Explore the books</a>
          <a class="button button-secondary" href="#about">Read his story</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="hero-note">
        <span class="quote-mark">“</span>
        <p>
          An author on a spiritual journey—a father learning to lead, a Son of God
          learning to follow, and a student of God’s Spirit who continues to ask
          questions.
        </p>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="intro-band">
      <div class="container intro-grid">
        <p class="section-label">The work</p>
        <p class="intro-text">
          His writing explores the relationship between belief and thought, the role
          of failure in spiritual growth, and what it means to follow Christ with
          humility, intelligence, and openness.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section container" id="about">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="section-label">01 / About</p>
        <h2>The student’s journey</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="two-column">
        <p class="large-copy">
          Born in Bonteheuwel, Cape Town, South Africa, Damiam V. Henry is an author,
          poet, podcaster, father, and lifelong student of God’s Spirit.
        </p>

        <div>
          <p>
            At the heart of his identity is a willingness to question, reconsider,
            observe, and learn. His writing explores how beliefs are formed, how
            thought shapes our relationship with God, and how silence and reflection
            can create room for transformation.
          </p>
          <p>
            He writes not only about what he has learned, but about what he is still
            learning.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section tinted" id="works">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="section-label">02 / Books</p>
          <h2>Published works</h2>
          <p>Each book marks a stage in a continuing spiritual and intellectual journey.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="book-grid">
          <article class="book-card">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Dialects of the Soul</h3>
            <p>The different voices and dimensions of spiritual experience.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="book-card">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Epignosis</h3>
            <p>An investigation into deep, experiential knowledge of God.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="book-card">
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Intangible</h3>
            <p>Reflections on the invisible aspects of faith and spirituality.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="book-card">
            <span>04</span>
            <h3>This Is Myself</h3>
            <p>An exploration of identity in relation to God and others.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="book-card">
            <span>05</span>
            <h3>To Be Continued</h3>
            <p>A reflection on the ongoing nature of spiritual transformation.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="book-card">
            <span>06</span>
            <h3>The Bird Feeder</h3>
            <p>Poetic reflections on patience, trust, and provision.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="book-card">
            <span>07</span>
            <h3>Known</h3>
            <p>A collection of teachings and spiritual insights.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="book-card">
            <span>08</span>
            <h3>Earlier Writing</h3>
            <p>Reflections on biblical figures, failure, fatherhood, and growth.</p>
          </article>
        </div>

        <a
          class="text-link"
          href="https://play.google.com/store/search?q=Damiam%20V%20Henry&c=books"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Find the books on Google Play Books ↗
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section container" id="beliefs">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="section-label">03 / Ideas</p>
        <h2>Questions worth asking</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="belief-grid">
        <div class="belief">
          <span>01</span>
          <h3>Faith and reason</h3>
          <p>Questions are not threats to belief; they can deepen it.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="belief">
          <span>02</span>
          <h3>Failure and growth</h3>
          <p>Stumbling is part of the journey when it becomes a teacher.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="belief">
          <span>03</span>
          <h3>Transformation</h3>
          <p>Following Christ changes how we think, perceive, and live.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="belief">
          <span>04</span>
          <h3>The journey continues</h3>
          <p>Spiritual maturity begins with knowing we have not yet arrived.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section audio-section" id="audio">
      <div class="container audio-content">
        <div>
          <p class="section-label">04 / Listen</p>
          <h2>Reflections in your ears.</h2>
          <p>
            Audio teachings and conversations explore faith and reason, spiritual growth,
            biblical figures, fatherhood, contemplative practice, and questions worth asking.
          </p>
        </div>

        <a
          class="button button-light"
          href="https://youtube.com/@damiamvhenry2026"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Visit YouTube ↗
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section container contact-section" id="contact">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="section-label">05 / Connect</p>
        <h2>Stay close to the work.</h2>
        <p>For thoughtful correspondence, collaboration, speaking, or prayer requests.</p>
      </div>

      <a class="email" href="mailto:damiamvhenry@gmail.com">damiamvhenry@gmail.com</a>

      <div class="socials">
        <a href="https://medium.com/@damiamvhenry" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Medium</a>
        <a href="https://damiamvhenry.bsky.social" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Bluesky</a>
        <a href="https://youtube.com/@damiamvhenry2026" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">YouTube</a>
        <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/damiamvhenry" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>
        <a href="https://amazon.com/author/damiamvhenry" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Amazon</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="container">
      <span>© 2026 Damiam V. Henry</span>
      <span>Faith • Thought • Transformation</span>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
